I conditionally copy `stringIndexes` only when it is non-empty, avoiding the vector copy-constructor overhead for the common case of numeric fields that have no string indexes.

```cpp
FieldBase::FieldBase(const FieldBase &field)
    : values(field.values)
{
    if (!field.stringIndexes.empty())
    {
        stringIndexes = field.stringIndexes;
    }
}
```